Supply_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when market not allowlisted for vault
   │  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
   └── when market allowlisted
      ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
      │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
      └── given known market
         ├── given vault has not approved adapter
         │  └── it should revert on transferFrom
         └── given vault approved adapter for at least assets
            ├── when reentered through token transfer hook
            │  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
            └── when not reentered
               ├── given Morpho returns zero share delta
               │  └── it should revert with NoShareDelta
               └── given Morpho returns positive share delta
                  ├── it should pull assets from vault
                  ├── it should call morpho.supply with onBehalf equal to vault
                  ├── it should call morpho.supply with empty data
                  ├── it should reset Morpho allowance to zero
                  ├── it should leave zero loan token in adapter
                  ├── it should leave zero allowance to Morpho
                  └── it should return non zero (assetsSupplied, sharesSupplied)
